  ctrl13_williams_otto_step / postDict -- the case's ONE figure
  (DEV.md 4c C487 slice 2; grammar: docs/design/a-post-processing-dictionary.md).

    response   "How do the product and waste rates answer a 5 % step in the
               feed of B?"  The plant's product P and waste G rates (klb/h) on
               the left axis, the feed F_fB (the Schedule FeedStep's MV, in
               kmol/s: 20 klb/h = 5.556e-3, 21 klb/h = 5.833e-3) on the right,
               the time axis in hours.  Read from this run's table (10 h grid,
               200 h): the step at 100 h; before it F_pP 3.9013 and F_wG
               1.2229 klb/h; at 110 h 4.2202 and 1.4635; at 200 h 4.4457 and
               1.9079.
